        <p dir="auto">Hi,</p>
<p dir="auto">I am using an AMD Ryzen Threadripper 9960X with Windows 10 LTSC IoT.</p>
<p dir="auto">When I run Handbrake 1.10.2 (2025090600) with the H.265 MKV 2160p60 4K for example, it only runs at 50% cpu.</p>
<p dir="auto">I contrast, when running with an Intel Core i9-14900K that is harder to drive with a mix of performance and economy cores, it reaches 100%.</p>
<p dir="auto">How can I optimize the 9960X usage?</p>
