    >
        <p dir="auto">Scaling can be limited by encoder, settings, resolution, and filtering. Encoding logs would help for specific recommendations. You can always try faster or slower encoder presets to get higher utilization. Or switch to SVT-AV1.</p>
<p dir="auto">14th gen Core is running a different codepath due to lack of AVX512, plus the E cores do less work so you need more of them to keep up with whatevers limiting hopefully scheduled on a P core. 14th gen Core also doesn't have the multi-CCD architecture challenges.</p>
    </td>
