    >
        <p dir="auto">Ah classic, not even using the preset you mentioned... this is why we want logs.</p>
<p dir="auto">Disable comb detection and deinterlace since your 24 fps content isn't, and I wouldn't bother with forcing fixed framerate.</p>
<p dir="auto">Preset matters less when you've got a bunch of dubious copypasta in the advanced options overriding it.</p>
<p dir="auto">Put asm=avx512 in the advanced video encoder options box to enable it, although it's disabled by default for a reason, it generally doesn't help especially below 4K and can hurt.</p>
<p dir="auto">If you're just chasing CPU utilization, try faster presets too.</p>
